,"compare_simplicity_FcaXca":{"type":"compare-simplicity","custom_css":[".compare_simplicity .compare_simplicity_contact_box_item a {-webkit-text-fill-color: #e5611c;}"],"name":"compare simplicity","settings":{"title":"","description":"","arrow_icon":"<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 11\" fill=\"none\">\n<path d=\"M1.16016 1.5L5.16016 5.5L1.16016 9.5\" stroke=\"#E5611C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><\/path>\n<\/svg>","product":"","show_compare":false,"customer_service_url":""}},"specs_simplicity_CFhWKH":{"type":"specs-simplicity","custom_css":[".specs_simplicity .specs_simplicity_title {background: #e5611c; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;}"],"settings":{"product":"","show_type":"one"}},"collapsible_content_HyyPmn":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"content_pXDQLJ":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"1. What is the Athena Pro Fnatic Edition gaming chair?","content":"<p>The Athena Pro Fnatic Edition is a special collaboration between Blacklyte and Fnatic, one of the world’s most iconic esports organizations. It combines Blacklyte’s flagship Athena Pro ergonomic structure with Fnatic-inspired design elements, created for competitive gamers and dedicated fans alike.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_rYegYT":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"2. Who should choose the Athena Pro Fnatic Edition?","content":"<p>This popular gaming chair is ideal for competitive gamers, esports fans, and anyone who values ergonomic performance combined with official Fnatic branding. It’s a strong choice for users who want both function and team-inspired design in their setup.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_wJ9yCq":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"3. How is the Fnatic Edition different from the standard Athena Pro?","content":"<p>This aesthetic gaming chair features exclusive Fnatic branding, team-inspired color accents, and unique design details not available on the standard Athena Pro. Structurally, it maintains the same high-performance ergonomic framework and build quality, while offering added collectible and visual appeal.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_pq9pqX":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"4. What ergonomic features does the Athena Pro Fnatic Edition offer?","content":"<p>This chair includes Blacklyte’s core Athena Pro ergonomic system, such as: multi-directional adjustable armrests; dynamic lumbar support; high-density memory foam cushioning; adjustable backrest recline; stable steel frame and reinforced base. All features are designed to support proper posture during long gaming or work sessions.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_wPRCtf":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"5. What height and weight range is this chair designed for?","content":"<p>The stylish Athena Pro Fnatic Edition gaming chair is designed to fit most users comfortably. It is generally recommended for users up to approximately 190 cm (6’2”) in height and 150 kg (330 lbs) in weight.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}},"content_aLc9yn":{"type":"content","settings":{"header_title_before_iconSvg":"","heading":"6. What warranty does the Athena Pro Fnatic Edition come with?","content":"<p>This elite gaming chair comes with a 3-year warranty as standard. By joining the <a href=\"\/pages\/warranty-extension\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warranty Extension\">Extend Warranty Program<\/a>, coverage can be extended up to 5 years for added long-term protection.<\/p>","page":"","show_header_title_before_icon":false}}},"block_order":["content_pXDQLJ","content_rYegYT","content_wJ9yCq","content_pq9pqX","content_